---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Contact – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Contact Colombia Tax Dates & Payroll: report a due date that does not match the rule, a payroll figure or a calculation that looks wrong. We reply by email only." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We read everything about dates, figures and calculations. There is no phone line and we will not call you.</p>
    <h2>Report an error</h2>
    <p>Does a date differ from the DIAN calendar or from your city's resolution, or has a payroll figure changed? Tell us the page, the NIT digits you tried and, if possible, a link to the official text. The fix applies to every page at once.</p>
    <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>We do not file returns, run payroll for you or give individual advice. For your own case, ask a Colombian public accountant (<em>contador público</em>) or an employment lawyer; questions about your tax account go to DIAN or your city's treasury through their official channels.</p>
    <h2>Embed the calculator</h2><p>The code is on the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>. Publisher and hosting: <a href={route('terms', lang)}>legal notice</a>.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
